WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.100 line:-2
<v President Richard Nixon>Nixon: In the past few days, however, it has become evident to me

2
00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:08.000 line:-2
<v President Richard Nixon>that I no longer have a strong enough political base

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000 line:-2
<v President Richard Nixon>in the Congress to justify continuing that effort.

4
00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:16.500 line:-2
<v President Richard Nixon>I have never been a quitter.

5
00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:20.200 line:-2
<v President Richard Nixon>To leave office before my term is completed

6
00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:23.300 line:-2
<v President Richard Nixon>is abhorrent to every instinct in my body.

7
00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:30.500 line:-2
<v President Richard Nixon>But as President, I must put the interests of America first.

8
00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:38.200 line:-2
<v President Richard Nixon>Therefore, I shall resign the Presidency effective at noon tomorrow.
